      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b25",
      "text": "七、形成性评价设计",
      "type": "heading",
      "items": [],
      "level": 1,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b26",
      "text": "• 过程证据：小组拼摆记录单、学生口头解释、练习错误类型、课堂退出条。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b27",
      "text": "• 核心评价问题：学生能否解释“为什么除以2”，而不仅仅是算对。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b28",
      "text": "• 评价标准暂采用“能正确计算 / 能解释转化关系 / 能处理变式”三个观察点；不同层次学生的具体达标阈值可进一步明确。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b29",
      "text": "八、作业设计",
      "type": "heading",
      "items": [],
      "level": 1,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b30",
      "text": "• 基础：完成教材中2道三角形面积计算题，并写出完整计算过程。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b31",
      "text": "• 应用：测量家中或校园里一个近似三角形物体的底和高，估算面积。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b32",
      "text": "• 拓展：画两个面积相同但形状明显不同的三角形，说明你怎样保证它们面积相同。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b33",
      "text": "九、板书设计",
      "type": "heading",
      "items": [],
      "level": 1,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b34",
      "text": "三角形的面积\n\n两个完全相同的三角形 → 拼成平行四边形\n平行四边形面积 = 底 × 高\n三角形面积 = 底 × 高 ÷ 2\nS = ah ÷ 2\n\n关键：底和高必须对应；“÷2”来自面积的一半。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b35",
      "text": "十、教学后反思预设",
      "type": "heading",
      "items": [],
      "level": 1,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b36",
      "text": "• 重点观察学生是否真正建立“转化前后底、高不变，面积关系变为一半”的联系。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b37",
      "text": "• 如果变式题中底高错配较多，下一课需增加“同一三角形不同底对应不同高”的可视化练习。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b38",
      "text": "• 小组合作中可能出现少数学生操作、其他学生旁观的情况，后续可增加明确角色分工。",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "items": [],
      "level": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "tableRows": [],
      "teachingProcess": null
    }
  ],
